# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
# All values here are optional — the site works fully without them.

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# When set, the site loads gtag.js and records page views plus calculator-use
# events (calculator id only — never input values or results). When unset,
# no analytics script is loaded and nothing is sent.
# Create the property in Google Analytics, then paste its Measurement ID here
# and in the Netlify environment variables for the deployed site.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
